main.c
--unwind 2 --rounds 2 --por --allow-pointer-unsoundness --slice-formula --verbosity 9
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
^VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL$
object bits: [0-9]* addressed objects need
--
too many addressed objects
--
The required "object bits:" line checks that the sizing fired; without the
function-call arguments the count stays under 256 and the line is missing.
--slice-formula is enough to remove the parameter assignments; --slice-values
removes them too.
